---
import InnerLayout from '../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout
  title="Industrial Automation | EVO"
  description="Industrial automation solutions from EVO including PLC, HMI, SCADA, panels, machine integration, upgrades and custom machinery."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION</p>
        <h1>Automation built for the <span>real world.</span></h1>
        <p>From control panels and PLC/HMI systems to machine integration, upgrades and custom equipment, EVO focuses on practical engineering that improves how production environments work.</p>
        <div class="page-hero-actions"><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Discuss an Automation Project ↗</a><a class="page-button page-button-secondary" href="/projects">See Related Work</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/solutions/solution-industrial-automation.png" alt="" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CAPABILITIES</p><h2>Control, machinery and <span>production integration.</span></h2></div><p>Projects can range from a focused control upgrade to a complete custom machine or integrated production solution.</p></div>
      <div class="card-grid-4">
        <article class="content-card"><span>01</span><h3>PLC / HMI / SCADA</h3><p>Control architecture, operator interfaces, sequencing and connected monitoring.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>02</span><h3>Panels &amp; Electrical Control</h3><p>Purpose-built automation and electrical panels for machines and processes.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>03</span><h3>Custom Machinery</h3><p>Mechanical, electrical and software work brought together around a specific task.</p></article>
        <article class="content-card"><span>04</span><h3>Upgrades &amp; Retrofits</h3><p>Modern controls, sensors, interfaces and safer operation for existing equipment.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="container split-inner">
      <div class="split-copy"><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING APPROACH</p><h2>Built to fit the <span>process.</span></h2><p>EVO starts with what the machine, operator and production environment actually need. The control strategy, panel, sensors, mechanical changes and software are then shaped around that reality.</p><div class="feature-list"><article><span>01</span><strong>Process Understanding</strong><p>Map the sequence, failure points and operator interaction.</p></article><article><span>02</span><strong>Control Architecture</strong><p>Select PLC, HMI, sensors, drives and communication strategy.</p></article><article><span>03</span><strong>Machine Integration</strong><p>Connect mechanical and electrical work with the control system.</p></article><article><span>04</span><strong>Commissioning</strong><p>Test, tune and hand over around real production conditions.</p></article></div></div>
      <div class="split-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/solutions/solution-industrial-automation.png" alt="" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band"><div class="container cta-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">AUTOMATE · UPGRADE · INTEGRATE</p><h2>Bring the machine problem. <span>We’ll shape the system.</span></h2></div><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Talk to EVO ↗</a></div></section>
</InnerLayout>
